Say hello.

14
00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:36.830
FirSt.

15
00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:44.890
I mean, I'm just thinking about everything we have to share about Niagara, the wedding episode.

16
00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:48.250
The enormous two-parter.

17
00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:49.970
We're doing it in two parts.

18
00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:50.930
This is so big.

19
00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:51.930
Oh, yeah.

20
