Today is Niagara Part 1.

21
00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.690
It was Season 6, Episode 4.

22
00:00:57.050 --> 00:01:03.170
It was written by Greg Daniels and Mindy Kaling and directed by Paul Feig.

23
